<mxfile host="app.diagrams.net" modified="2026-09-29T00:00:00.000Z" agent="EqualPath" version="24.7.17"><diagram id="epic6" name="Epic 6 Recommendation Framework"><mxGraphModel dx="1600" dy="1000" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1600" pageHeight="1000" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="title" value="EqualPath · Search + Personalised Recommendation Framework (Epic 6)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#30382f;strokeColor=#30382f;fontColor=#30382f;fontSize=24;spacing=10;verticalAlign=middle;align=left;fontColor=#ffffff;fontStyle=1;align=center;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="30" y="20" width="1540" height="65" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="subtitle" value="Principle: search conditions decide usability; recommendation only reranks eligible results. Reviews are not live availability." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f3f4ec;strokeColor=#d6d9cc;fontColor=#30382f;fontSize=15;spacing=10;verticalAlign=middle;align=left;fontColor=#596451;align=center;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="30" y="95" width="1540" height="38" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="g1" value="1. INPUT SIGNALS" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dfe8d6;strokeColor=#a3b18d;fontColor=#30382f;fontSize=16;spacing=10;verticalAlign=middle;align=left;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="30" y="155" width="360" height="36" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="g2" value="2. EVIDENCE + HARD GATES" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dfe8d6;strokeColor=#a3b18d;fontColor=#30382f;fontSize=16;spacing=10;verticalAlign=middle;align=left;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="410" y="155" width="370" height="36" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="g3" value="3. PERSONALISED RERANK" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e7e2cc;strokeColor=#b4a56b;fontColor=#30382f;fontSize=16;spacing=10;verticalAlign=middle;align=left;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="800" y="155" width="380" height="36" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="g4" value="4. OUTPUT + LEARNING" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e7e2cc;strokeColor=#b4a56b;fontColor=#30382f;fontSize=16;spacing=10;verticalAlign=middle;align=left;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1200" y="155" width="370" height="36" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="search" value="Current search request
• care type（short-time / regular）
• 地点、半径、日期
• start / end time
• 年龄、pickup、排序方式" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#9daa8d;fontColor=#30382f;fontSize=16;spacing=10;verticalAlign=middle;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="50" y="220" width="320" height="128" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="prefs" value="First-use preferences (skippable)
Choose up to 3 review-derived preferences
Examples: smooth pickup, clear fees, responsive team" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#9daa8d;fontColor=#30382f;fontSize=16;spacing=10;verticalAlign=middle;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="50" y="380" width="320" height="112" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="history" value="Browser-local behaviour
• saved centre
• compare
• viewed
• hide / reset
Time-decayed and isolated by care type" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#9daa8d;fontColor=#30382f;fontSize=16;spacing=10;verticalAlign=middle;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="50" y="525" width="320" height="112" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="reviews" value="Branch-level review evidence
Source, branch identity and retrieval time
Review text / topics → automatic classification
Overall stars never become preferences" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#9daa8d;fontColor=#30382f;fontSize=16;spacing=10;verticalAlign=middle;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="50" y="670" width="320" height="125" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="taxonomy" value="Review classifier
Level 1: temporary care / pickup / Late collection / fees / communication
