At least 2 supporting reviews for the same branch and topic
Below threshold → unknown
provider listing / one review is not enough" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#9daa8d;fontColor=#30382f;fontSize=15;spacing=10;verticalAlign=middle;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="430" y="390" width="330" height="112" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="eligibility" value="Current search hard gates
care type · radius · location
age · date · start/end · pickup
Conflict: grey / does not match
unknown: keep and explain" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fffdf8;strokeColor=#9c8a56;fontColor=#30382f;fontSize=15;spacing=10;verticalAlign=middle;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="430" y="535" width="330" height="145" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="weekend" value="Weekend rule
周六/周日 care end = Not listed
→ conflict (not usable), not unknown" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f8eee7;strokeColor=#a36a55;fontColor=#30382f;fontSize=15;spacing=10;verticalAlign=middle;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="430" y="710" width="330" height="86" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="signals" value="Combine personalisation signals
• selected preferences
• review evidence support
