base: distance + known condition fit
personalisation: history / similarity
preference nudge: capped at 0.22
unknown adds no score" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fffdf8;strokeColor=#b4a56b;fontColor=#30382f;fontSize=15;spacing=10;verticalAlign=middle;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="820" y="380" width="340" height="130" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="rerank" value="Rerank eligible results only
Keep explicit sort (price / closing / pickup)
known conflicts last
contact priority is internal only" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fffdf8;strokeColor=#b4a56b;fontColor=#30382f;fontSize=15;spacing=10;verticalAlign=middle;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="820" y="545" width="340" height="135" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="cold" value="Cold start
没有偏好/历史：距离 + 已知匹配
First-use preference page supplies the first signal
